WEBVTT

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:15.010
Bungo
Stray

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.010
Dogs

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.990
Wan!

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.990
"Special"

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.030
<b>Episode 18</b>

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.670
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool!

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.030
<b>Bungo Stray
 Dogs Preschool</b>

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:23.990
Hey.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Junior Caretaker</b>

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Dazai-Sensei</b>

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.920
Dazai-sensei, what's this?

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.180
This is a rope for hanging—

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.430
I got it!

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.920
It's for playing choo-choo train!

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:36.010
Here we go!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.060
Chugga-chugga.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.360
Yay!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.980
What are you doing with Dazai-sensei, 
weretiger? He's busy!

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.850
W-Want to join us, Akutagawa-kun?

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:49.850
I will.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.360
Chugga-chug!

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.070
Next stop, Armed Detective Agency!
 Armed Detective Agency!

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.610
Pschhh...

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.210
What are they, kids?!

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:00.370
<b>Chuuya-kun</b>

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:00.370
<b>(Senior)</b>

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.620
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.620
<b>Ideals</b>

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.630
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.370
Kunikida-kun! I can't find 
the ball! I can't play!

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.380
Don't worry.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:15.130
<b>Ideals</b>

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.740
Special ability: Doppo Poet!

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:14.140
<i>Doppo Poet is a special ability which allows him to 
materialize things by writing them in his notebook.</i>

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.140
Yay!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.390
"Ball."

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>ll b a</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.300
How do you write "ball" again?

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.590
U-Um...

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.140
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs
 Preschool</b>

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.140
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.150
It's nap time.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.150
Nii-sama.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:31.640
Let's sleep together like children.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.070
<b>Clinggg</b>

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.460
I-I can't breathe, Naomi!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:38.020
<i>She finally got off me.</i>

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.790
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:45.780
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:47.800
<i>How does Kenji-kun fare?</i>

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:50.430
Time to have lunch.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.300
I'm full and satisfied.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.690
Time to nap.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.040
I woke up and now I'm hungry.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.710
Time to have a snack.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:02.680
A beef bowl?!

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.930
I'm sleepy again.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.940
<i>He's the same as usual.</i>

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.190
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.180
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.060
Kyouka-chan!

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.510
What's that?

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.580
This is a pair of scissors.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:20.870
You shouldn't use them to stab 
people or assassinate them.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.590
I-I won't.

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:28.910
Crab?

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:29.830
Bunny.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.450
Penguin?

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:33.340
Cow.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.900
Water flea?

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:36.840
Tiger.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.830
Demon snow!

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.210
I'm sorry!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.470
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.470
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.440
Wah-wah, weretiger!

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.460
Go cry to Dazai, crybaby!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.980
Try making me cry if you don't like it!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:54.750
You're older than me, but you're short.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.450
Hey!

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.960
You've got some nerve.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:03.610
I might be small now, but I'm 
going to be big in the future.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:08.030
Did you know? Drinking milk
 makes you taller.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:10.250
You'll get bigger if you drink milk?

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.300
Yeah.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.480
And I drink milk every day.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.160
You'll get big, then!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.360
Right?!

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.750
<b>Bam</b>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.010
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs
 Preschool</b>

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.000
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.460
Okay, everyone, gather 'round!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:24.120
It's story time!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.930
No Longer Human

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.930
Dazai Osamu

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.720
I'll read you this book today.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:29.520
I've led a life filled with shame.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:34.010
I can't quite grasp what it 
means to live as a human.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.010
<i>This isn't suitable reading for children.</i>

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:37.160
What's wrong, kids?

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.110
Oh, did you want me to read you 
<i>Discourse on Decadence</i> instead?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.030
No, you dumb teacher!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.980
I think we should read <i>Rashoumon</i>.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.030
Why don't we read
 <i>The Makioka Sister</i> for once?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.890
Let's read poems, Dazai!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.780
"For The Tainted Sorrow"!

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.420
I don't think any of those are for kids.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:56.790
What's going on? It sounds lively in here.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.400
Yosano-sensei!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.670
Ozaki-sensei!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.170
<b>Momotaro</b>

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.170
<b>The Boy and
 the Puppy</b>

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.190
I brought you some picture books.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:08.860
Poke, poke, poke.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:10.810
You've got some nerve 
stepping over me, kids.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.930
Poke, poke, poke, poke.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.290
<i>And so went another fun 
day at the preschool.</i>

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.440
Not fun!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:19.440
<b>She's actually
 really crafty!</b>

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.690
Gather 'round, everyone!

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:28.700
We have some new friends at our preschool.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.440
Edogawa Rampo-kun, and...

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.790
Is he shy?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.350
Kajii Motojirou-kun!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.720
I love bombs and stuff!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.720
He sounds really dangerous!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.960
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.960
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.750
Our block castle broke again.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.200
What shall we do?

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.440
Rampo-kun.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:45.710
Let's find them.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.630
Let's play ball together.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.460
Play with me.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.480
Origami with Kyouka-chan 
and the others is fun, too.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.700
I don't like childish games.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.490
Wha?!

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:58.860
<i>It's hard making friends with Rampo-kun.</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.570
Oh, I heard there's a special 
snack for the two of us today.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.680
A special snack...

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.740
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.730
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.490
<b>One Hundred 
World Bombs</b>

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.500
Hey, newbie!

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:14.320
I challenge you to rugby.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.690
I'll show you who's the boss.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.360
Sure.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.690
You can cry, but a challenge is a challenge.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.660
He threw a bomb at me!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.810
I swear! Believe me!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:27.670
You!

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.270
What was that explosion just now?

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:31.430
Oh? You caught me.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.020
I love lemon-shaped bombs.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.020
You'd better not be using 
those on Dazai-sensei.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:37.790
No way.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:38.440
I see.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.360
You're all right, then.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.530
Eh? Really?

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.830
Want one of these bombs I made?

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.380
You can make bombs?!

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.720
That's so awesome!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.830
I-I actually have another special ability.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.900
I like you.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.820
We're buddies now.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.860
Let's go bomb Dazai.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.430
<i>I don't know if I should 
be friends with you.</i>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.670
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs
 Preschool</b>

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.660
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.720
<b>Rampo-kun found 
something Atsushi-kun lost</b>

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.300
Thank you!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.670
How did you know?!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.590
Anyone could guess if they heard you talk.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.980
No way!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.150
You're amazing.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.710
You're an amazing detective!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:17.960
Sorry for getting too close.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.380
You can talk to me again 
if you need anything.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.730
Rampo-kun!

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:26.120
<i>I wonder if Rampo-kun's getting 
along with the others.</i>

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.360
Hey...

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.460
Can I join?

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.990
Of course you can!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.800
Can I borrow that?

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.000
Do I...

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.250
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs 
Preschool</b>

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.240
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.320
Let go!

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.390
<i>You</i> let go!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:44.290
Don't pull it there, you two!

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.560
You'll tear it!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.880
<b>Everyone Loves Odasaku Man!</b>

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:49.400
<i>Everyone Loves Odasaku Man!</i>

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.880
Go!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool</b>

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:58.350
<i>Odasaku Man!</i>

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.090
Flawless Punch!

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.640
It's an Odasaku Man plushie.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.950
I brought it from home.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.620
Don't tell Sensei.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:10.970
Is that what you're into?

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.140
You're such a kid!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:15.390
I don't watch kids' shows. I watch the news!

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.860
Look! It's Odasaku Man!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:18.580
Really?!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.380
No.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.420
What's wrong with him?

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.890
I feel sorry for him.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.010
If you have something to say,
 say it to my face!

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.250
Chuuya-kun.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.440
You can borrow it, if you like it so much.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:31.080
I-I-I don't like it.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:36.830
I just watch it every week, record it, 
and watch it over and over.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.270
I don't think it's cool or anything.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.660
You must love it.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:44.410
I mean, I'll play with it, if you insist.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.460
Hey, it's Odasaku Man!

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.520
I love him, too.

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.650
Huh? What's with the face?

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:55.100
You like Odasaku Man 
even though you're a grown-up?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.580
I love him.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.400
Weird.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:01.820
Atsushi, he's just playing 
along because we're kids.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:02.800
Oh.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.910
There's no way a grown-up 
would like Odasaku Man!

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.430
Ouch!

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:06.420
<b>Ouch</b>

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.500
You lied and said you like Odasaku Man!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.600
They won't believe me...

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.560
Why don't you show them 
your non-work clothes?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.590
That might cause problems.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.630
It's true that he likes Odasaku Man.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.160
Akutagawa-kun?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:34.660
<b>Outdoor Super Stage</b>

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:34.660
<b>Odasaku Man Show</b>

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.520
I can't wait for the Odasaku Man Show!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.410
I'm only here because I was invited.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.550
Is this a date?!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.410
<i>Right, Tachihara's here, too.</i>

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.760
Hey, you guys are here, too.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.140
Dazai-sensei!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.500
Yay! Here we go!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.640
Go!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.410
You're right.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:47.710
He actually likes him.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.930
Sensei looks so happy.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.660
Odasaku-man isn't in the picture.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:55.170
<i>Dazai-sensei's love for 
Odasaku Man was proven.</i>

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.680
<b>Bungo Stray Dogs
 Preschool</b>

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.290
Bungo Stray Dogs Preschool.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.900
You're getting a special snack today.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:01.920
Yay!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.810
Another special snack!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.730
Snacking together!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.180
Let's eat lots!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.950
What is this?

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:13.450
It's as if...

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.740
It's as if there's been an explosion.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.480
Staaare...

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.480
Staaaare...

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.830
<b>Staaare</b>

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:18.480
Wh-What?!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.810
I didn't do it!

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.960
Yeah!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.450
Kajii was with me, 
plotting to blow up Dazai!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:25.710
That's so suspicious!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.210
Guys, hear me out.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.280
Rampo-kun?

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.450
Ultra-Deduction!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:36.340
<i>Ultra-Deduction is an ability which allows him 
to solve a case just by putting on his glasses.</i>

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:39.170
The clearly intentional way
 the curtain was cut...

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:42.490
The individually wrapped candies, so they
 can be eaten after they touch the floor...

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.100
The only person who could have 
made the room the way it is...

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.920
It's none other than Dazai-sensei!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.800
Hey, everyone.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.500
You're all here.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.690
Shocked?

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.720
This was my surprise for you.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:59.240
I'm so glad you're all hanging out together.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.230
Um... Why are you looking at me like that?

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.770
Let's blow this guy up!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.640
What?! Why?!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:42.720
Yosano-sensei, expressing one's 
 affection can be so difficult.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:45.130
You take things too far.
